 claim at the anchoring checkpoint cp28 rather than at D, which would either fabricate a disagreement or, with a doctored disposition set, assert completeness the producer never claimed. It is rejected because `claim_material.corpus_checkpoint` must be the propagation's OWN declared checkpoint (core §2.3.4, receipt §3): cp28's identity fields do not match the `{log_id, tree_size, root_hash}` the statement itself declares. Completeness never extends past D; the enlargement creates a fresh propagation duty instead (core §5.2).","type":"propagation-complete"},"claim_material":{"corpus_checkpoint":{"checkpoint_time":"2026-08-16T12:00:00Z","key_id":"sha256:b62e867fa2f33afe62d5d6b1642e1621d543307846b2a57b897e710919b76709","log_id":"sha256:f96bab99f35b3ca221f3f233369835c3ee222f4b2e6c00f84b3a24f840f017a0","root_hash":"sha256:5e9cf0541692e2d46da59b8e94054529b47d774d2cefa1476220fd94d4ae8023","signature":"base64:hu0HLCFfeT+2BesrhmkpGgBHnUZxWLSqG6crjHnIZK7wzWbXIZQzb+Mgmi1VqqnEqfrVO2jtjv6JpQkq7IB5AQ==","tree_size":28},"corpus_prefix":{"entries":[{"entry_index":0,"envelope":{"payload":{"ahl_version":"0.3","datasets":{"customers":{"authority":{"key_ids":["sha256:34750f98bd59fcfc946da45aaabe933be154a4b5094e1c4abf42866505f3c97e"],"producer":"producer-1"},"canonicalization":"jcs-v1","commitment_mode":"keyed","key_access":"authorized-verifiers-only"},"scores":{"canonicalization":"jcs-v1","commitment_mode":"plain","key_access":"not-applicable"}},"issued_at":"2026-08-16T12:00:00Z","keys":[{"key_id":"sha256:34750f98bd59fcfc946da45aaabe933be154a4b5094e1c4abf42866505f3c97e","pubkey":"base64:iojj3XQJ8ZX9UtstPLpdcspnCb8dlBIb83SIAbQPb1w=","valid_from_index":0}],"level":"L3","log":{"adaptor":{"hash":"sha256:ea4e9a7d9f4c2286fe2a0a292e939ef6c2261c8567b3d91cd7375c5490525961","id":"ahl-test-log-v1"},"cadence_epoch":"2026-08-16T11:30:00Z","checkpoint_cadence":"PT1H","keys":[{"key_id":"sha256:b62e867fa2f33afe62d5d6b1642e1621d543307846b2a57b897e710919b76709","pubkey":"base64:7UkoxijRwsbq6QM4kFmVYSlZJ